  "_doc": "Per-level upgrade pools (DESIGN.md section 8 [CANON]). The shop never shows the full catalog; the game maps the player's level to the bracket whose [min_level, max_level] contains it (max_level null = open-ended). Level 1 is exactly paycheck, more, yearn_for_speed; every later bracket lists all upgrades whose tier has entered the pool (tier pool-from levels in \"tiers\" below: T1 at 1, T2 at 4, T3 at 10, T4 at 18, T5 at 26). An upgrade also needs tier min level <= level. Draw: 3 distinct, not at max stacks, weighted x2 for items the current class boosts (class_boost in each upgrade file), seeded; affordability filter price <= max(2 x purse, 80).",
